251:{character:player} Ahaha... Maybe we should all take another look at what I sent?
252:{character:Reina Nanami} KECC...RAZY...
253:{character:Chiori Mikami} That's not right! It's KEC, CRAZY, THURSDAY, V, ME, 50!! It's KEC crazy Thursday, give me 50 bucks??
254:{character:Hinata Takanashi} Hmph. I'm never gonna believe {var:player_nickname} ever again!
255:{character:player} My bad, my bad. To make it up to you all, let me treat everyone to KEC today!
