342:{character:player} That she is. Anyway, I've agreed to help her find her friend.
343:I briefly fill in Ichihime about Eve and Lily, then pull out my phone and show her the photo.
344:{character:Ichihime} She looks a little familiar, nyaa! If she's a blonde nun... Nyaa? A blonde nun came to the shrine once, said she wanted to do some cultural exchange...
345:{character:player} Do you still remember her, Ichihime?
346:{character:Ichihime} No... Because the person responsible for overseeing the cultural exchange back then was Wanjirou. Maybe you should go ask him, nyaa.
347:{character:player} Can I cut down your snack rations?
348:{character:Ichihime} Nyaa? Nyaa-aa?! Nyaa—How could you do such a thing, Master?!
349:{character:player} Because, Ichihime, I've suddenly realized that all you do these days is eat...
