351:{character:player} Can't you shrine people just send some little magical paper cranes like they do in anime?
352:{character:Ichihime} You've seen too much anime, Master, nyaa...! Besides, with modern communications you can solve this kind of stuff easily just with your phone, so why bother doing such a troublesome ceremony? Instead of thinking about Ichihime's teeny little snacking problem, Master should watch fewer weird shows!
353:{character:player} Let's change the subject... When's Wanjirou getting here?
354:{character:Ichihime} Wanjirou said that he happens to be playing Mahjong at a nearby dojo. Why don't we go look for him there, Master? Otherwise, knowing Wanjirou, he's probably gonna forget about everything but his game.
355:{character:player} Good idea.
356:{character:Ichihime} Nyaa? Master has a VIP card too?
357:{character:player} What do you mean, "too"? Don't tell me...
358:{character:Ichihime} Fu Ji said Ichihime was her favorite, so she gave me a card, nyaa!
359:{character:player} Does Wanjirou have one too?
360:{character:Ichihime} Nyaa-nyaa! Master is so clever! Not just Wanjirou, but Mai, Miki, Chiori... Everyone has one, nyaa!
361:{character:Fu Ji} What fair wind has brought {var:player_nickname} to us today? No wonder Wanjirou refused to play with me just now, saying he was waiting for someone. Turns out it was you lot!
362:{character:player} That's right. There's something I wanted to speak to him about, so it made sense to arrange a game at the same time.
363:{character:Wanjirou} Sure took your sweet time, didn't you? I and another fellow player were close to drifting off. Anyway, come along, this way... Oh, Fu Ji, I thought I saw someone looking for you when I came in, woof.
364:{character:Fu Ji} Then I guess I'll be on my way, {var:player_nickname}. Remember to let me know in advance of your next visit! I must play a few rounds with you!
365:{character:Wanjirou} Ah—at least in the future we will share the joy and the pain. Fear not, this old gent'll look after you, woof!
366:{character:Ichihime} Nyaa—How can this be nyaaaaa—
367:{character:Wanjirou} Oh, could you be a bit more careful, Ichihime.
368:{character:Ichihime} Nyaa! It wasn't intentional! Someone made that Dora just too enticing, nyaa!
369:{character:Wanjirou} But it's not like you collected the Dora yourself! They were all fed to you, woof.
370:{character:Young Woman} It's okay! As long as there is a winner, there will be LOSERS! He-he!
371:{character:Ichihime} Chii, nyaa!
372:{character:Wanjirou} Hey hey hey! You're too careless, Ichihime!
373:{character:Wanjirou} Didn't I say? Since when did what you need just fall from the sky? I can't even play without worrying about you all the time, wan.
374:{character:Ichihime} Nyaaaaa!! Wanjirou, do you want to be on shrine cleaning duty for all of next month, nyaa?!
375:{character:Young Woman} Ah, the priestess of Mahjong Soul Shrine is indeed quite lucky! I'm almost jealous!
